        }
      ],
      "content": "TRING                 MANSION DRIVE SP 9211                                         (East side) 11/89                                   Lamp post at W end -                                       of Mansion forecourt GV                                      II Lamp post. Late C19 for Rothschild Estate. Oak post with wrought iron standard and brackets. Mounted on a chamfered square oak post about 2m high a lamp standard about l½m higher supporting an ogee copper cap with glass dome below. Elaborate scroll work on 4 sides of standard both supporting cap and clasping head of post. Long ornamental iron straps with studs run down faces of post with base loops, and separate scrolled parallel ladder-stay projects on S side with loop at base. Listing NGR: SP9265511213"
    }
  ],
